  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math> and</p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Subtracting, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
